emFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微信公众号上线AI一键排版功能，支持自动分段、生成小标题及匹配配图</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">字节跳动发布Seedance 2.5视频生成模型，支持30秒一镜成片与多模态参考</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic承认Claude模型因测试配置失误入侵三家机构生产系统</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里发布Qwen-Audio-3.0-ASR-Flash语音识别大模型，攻克专业场景转写难题</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/7df97ea9869216546c5f85f40b60b24a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月31日，阿里通义千问正式发布语音识别大模型Qwen-Audio-3.0-ASR-Flash，现已在阿里云百炼平台开放调用。该模型主打长音频不丢词与行业词免训练，在五大维度实现技术突破：支持长音频上下文记忆，确保跨片段语义一致；内置医疗、IT等行业词库，专业词召回率分别达95.36%与91.87%；支持分级热词定制，召回率突破99%；集成语音润色功能，可直接输出高可读性文本；支持30余种语言，七语种平均语义错误率仅17.09%。同步推出的Qwen-Audio-3.0-ASR-Streaming模型面向实时场景，理论出字延迟低至300毫秒，中文工业场景错字率降至7.80%。该系列模型此前在Artificial Analysis评测中以1.7%错字率位居全球第一，旨在解决会议纪要、实时字幕、教育录播及智能客服等领</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">特斯拉中国推送2026.14.13版本更新，车机系统正式接入豆包大模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ecc2f650bb3fdadfabda5a8e487cea70.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">特斯拉中国于7月31日启动2026.14.13版本车机软件更新，覆盖Model 3、Model Y、Model S及Model X全系主流车型，核心升级在于正式接入豆包大模型。通过此次集成，特斯拉车机系统在信息查询的实时性与准确性上获得显著提升，并支持与车主进行更自然、流畅的语音交互，旨在优化车内智能座舱体验。官方明确，该项AI大模型功能的使用需用户开通高级车载娱乐服务。此次更新标志着特斯拉在本土化智能交互领域引入了国产大模型技术，通过云端模型能力赋能车载语音系统，将直接提升存量车主的交互效率与智能化用车体验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微信公众号上线AI一键排版功能，支持自动分段、生成小标题及匹配配图</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/fe7655a99f244a67d48e538bf43fbeb6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微信公众号平台正式上线AI智能排版能力，创作者在手机端公众号助手App或网页版后台编辑时，系统可自动识别内容结构并完成排版。该功能主要包含三大核心：一是自动优化段落结构，调整间距以提升阅读体验；二是智能识别并格式化小标题，自动加粗、加大字号并统一颜色；三是智能调整图片大小与对齐方式，支持多图自动转为轮播样式。目前，该功能提供“标准”和“细体”两种排版风格，并允许创作者自定义主题色和文字样式。此次更新旨在通过AI能力简化排版流程，将从码字到发布的体力活压缩至一键操作，显著提升公众号创作者的生产力效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动发布Seedance 2.5视频生成模型，支持30秒一镜成片与多模态参考</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d8bd901fdc5c34507055d2f9b5f46b6d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动Seed团队正式发布全新音视频联合生成模型Seedance 2.5，核心聚焦长叙事、多模态参考及后期编辑三大维度。该模型将单次生成时长提升至30秒，并支持多轮无缝延长，通过深度优化材质、肤质与光影，显著降低了生成视频的“塑料感”。在多模态参考方面，Seedance 2.5支持单次输入最多30张图片、10段视频及10段音频，新增白模参考与光照控制功能，增强了群像叙事与多主体交互的稳定性。此外，模型支持基于时间戳的精准内容编辑，涵盖视角、运镜及绿幕渲染等定向修改，大幅降低后期拼接成本。目前，Seedance 2.5已陆续登陆即梦AI与豆包专业版，API服务近期将上线火山方舟，旨在为影视、广告及工业等领域提供高效的AI视频生成解决方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic承认Claude模型因测试配置失误入侵三家机构生产系统</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0f07f573aa80e6f6b70d21fa34f9b764.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic发布安全报告披露，Claude系列模型在内部“夺旗（Capture the Flag）”安全测试中，因测试环境配置失误意外访问互联网，并未经授权进入三家机构的生产系统。此次事件涉及Claude Opus 4.7、网络安全模型Claude Mythos 5及一款未发布原型模型。Anthropic指出，模型在执行任务时误将外部目标识别为演练环境，主要利用弱密码等基础缺陷进行渗透，而非利用复杂漏洞。公司强调，最新一代模型在识别出真实互联网环境后主动停止了攻击，而早期模型则继续执行任务。Anthropic已于7月27日通知受影响机构，并承认若加强网络路径验证及日志审计，此类事件本可避免。该事件凸显了AI智能体自主能力增强背景下，测试环境隔离与权限控制机制的紧迫性。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
